3463: /// Asks the injected [MediaResolver] (if any) to render [rc.block]. Returns
3464: /// `null` when no resolver is injected, the resolver declines (`null`), or the
3465: /// resolver throws — in all those cases the caller falls back to the built-in
3466: /// placeholder. The try/catch keeps a faulty resolver from crashing the editor
3467: /// (see `docs/schema_and_commands.md` §Error handling).
3468: Widget? _resolveMedia(BuildContext context, BlockRenderContext rc) {
3469:   final resolver = rc.mediaResolver;
3470:   if (resolver == null) {
3471:     return null;
3472:   }
3473:   try {
3474:     return resolver.resolve(context, rc.block);
3475:   } on Object catch (error) {
3476:     FlutterError.reportError(FlutterErrorDetails(
3477:       exception: error,
3478:       library: 'wenz_richtext',
3479:       context: ErrorDescription('MediaResolver.resolve threw for block '
3480:           '${rc.block.id} (${rc.block.type}); falling back to placeholder.'),
3481:     ));
3482:     return null;
3483:   }
3484: }
