0321: /// To start from the built-in defaults, construct the registry and then call
0322: /// [WenzRichTextEditor.installDefaultRenderers]; or use the editor's
0323: /// [WenzRichTextEditor.blockRenderers] parameter — when omitted the editor
0324: /// builds a private registry with the defaults already installed.
